  "definitions": {
    "reference": "Each saved 98-digit MP90 decimal is interpreted as an exact decimal rational for this comparison. It remains a finite approximate variational reference.",
    "native": "Decode each canonical little-endian 10-byte x87 encoding as its exact binary rational.",
    "boundary64": "Interpret each saved boundary binary64 as its exact binary rational; independently verify it is the nearest-even conversion of the saved native value, including signed zero.",
    "columns": "Original stage input Q[0:20], pi[20:40]. No input-column port rescaling.",
    "equation_rows": "Q[0:20], pi[20:40], first mean[40], second mean[41].",
    "physical_rows": "Divide only output pi rows 20:40 by the exact binary64 portRatio. Q and both mean rows are unchanged. Apply the same row conversion to both matrices.",
    "error": "All differences, maxima and ratios are computed with Fraction, not floating summation.",
    "max_absolute": "Maximum absolute entry of candidate minus reference over the stated block.",
    "global_relative": "Block maximum absolute difference divided by the maximum absolute reference entry in that same block; this is not a componentwise relative error or induced operator norm.",
    "zero_denominator": "If reference max is zero, return 0 only when the difference is also zero; otherwise return null with denominator_zero=true. No artificial denominator floor.",
    "peak": "Zero-based row,column of the first lexicographic maximum nonzero difference; null when all zero.",
    "display": "Compact decimal strings use 32 significant digits, nearest rounding for presentation; they are not outward interval bounds. Exact rational differences/statistics stay in scratch.",
    "scope": "Native and MP variational matrices are evaluated along their respective approximate LD and MP90 trajectories and roots, with frozen capsule floor 0.1. The discrepancy includes trajectory/root differences. No derivative of the stopping algorithm, DN acceptance, matrix conditioning, continuous error or production floor 0.05 adaptor is asserted.",
    "acceptance": "No new numerical acceptance threshold. Report every prescribed block for all three stages."
  },
